# November 20, 2026: Baker County, Oregon (Baker City, Sumpter, the Sumpter Valley, Whitney, Bourne, Cornucopia, Unity),
# with Granite, the Ah Hee Diggings and the Fremont Powerhouse just over the line in Grant County. A first pass, drawn at
# random by tools/choose.py (region or). Gold-rush ground: a dredge, a narrow-gauge railroad, ghost towns, Chinese miners'
# rock walls and burial ground, Oregon Trail ruts, and the tuff-stone public buildings of Baker City.
