# texts, the pages of Oregon State Parks, the BLM, the Forest Service, the Sumpter Valley Railroad, the cathedral parish and
# Crossroads Carnegie Art Center, SAH Archipedia, the Oregon Encyclopedia, Baker City Herald and La Grande Observer
# articles, recreation.gov, historicsumpter.com, and Wikipedia read with tools/wiki_raw.py.
